  {
   "id": 519802,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/80713a168eeee1e6.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<figcaption>(credit: modification of work from STIHL)</figcaption>\n</figure>",
   "stem_html": "<p>The image show a strawberry plant.</p>\n<p>What are the long, horizontal stalks that grow sideways from the pot?</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1014731,
     "content_html": "Runners that will produce clone plants."
    },
    {
     "id": 1014732,
     "content_html": "Corms, that store starches."
    },
    {
     "id": 1014733,
     "content_html": "Tubers, that store starches."
    },
    {
     "id": 1014734,
     "content_html": "Rhizomes, that can produce clone plants."
    }
